// Seeds to fetch on ledges, an ember fenced between pillars, two chasms with two stones, a dip and a step to the door.
name Two Blooms
rule B1234/S012345678
steps 2
hint You woke empty-handed: a seed lies on the ledge just ahead, another past the first chasm. Two stones, two blooms. Grow the first to cross, plant the second, press R to rewind, stand clear, grow both.
tip Rewind clears the growth but keeps every planted seed. Jump over the ember when it comes at you; it cannot leave its run between the posts.
intro Two beginnings, two crossings. Whoever came this way before carried two seeds and knew where to stand. An ember still walks the road.
outro Two seeds, two bridges. Nothing that grows stays small.
